// Language server main loop: same parse and check as `j3c`, stdio JSON-RPC.
//
// Port of: j3c/src/lsp/mod.rs
// J3: A handler table on the shared JSON-RPC loop in `lsp/proto` (plan 11 B12.4). Each recheck is a new
// `driver.Session` with its own arena; the old one is dropped when the new one replaces it, and memo
// entries (B5) are copied into a cache arena with a size cap (B6). No `ProgramCache` that rechecks the
// whole program on any edit: per-module rechecks once the B5 memo table exists. Gate: the harness runs
// the LSP over 1000 edits of one file and RSS must level off.
module j3c.lsp;
